WEBVTT

00:13:28.729 --> 00:13:32.109
tik preden si prišel sem na to seanso.

00:13:32.109 --> 00:13:33.805
Boyd Varty: Hvala, Pat.

00:13:33.805 --> 00:13:36.988
Zelo sem vesel, ker je prišel njegov čas.

00:13:36.988 --> 00:13:38.759
Trpel je.

00:13:38.759 --> 00:13:41.157
In seveda so tu mešani občutki.

00:13:41.157 --> 00:13:43.141
Ampak spomnim se
toliko različnih stvari,

00:13:43.141 --> 00:13:45.548
na primer takrat, 
ko je odšel na Oprah show

00:13:45.548 --> 00:13:48.404
in jo vprašal, o čem bo oddaja govorila.

00:13:48.404 --> 00:13:49.882
(Smeh)

00:13:49.882 --> 00:13:53.180
In rekla je,"No, o tebi bo govorila."

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.928
Mislim, ta neverjetna skromnost.

00:13:55.928 --> 00:13:59.591
(Smeh)

00:13:59.591 --> 00:14:02.753
Bil je oče našega naroda